{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"contentTxt\"><p>【Now新聞台】【06:02】神二十四乘組湯洪波、武毅及阿里陸續進入飛船。</p></div>\n<div class=\"contentTxt\"><p>【05:55】神二十四乘組湯洪波、武毅及阿里抵達酒泉衛星發射中心，準備進入飛船。</p></div>\n<div class=\"contentTxt\"><p>【05:32】神二十四乘組指令長由湯洪波擔任，帶同航天員武毅及阿里一同現身圓夢園廣場，向在場的民眾揮手，再逐一登上專車，在車隊的護送下，前往發射場。</p></div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T22:24:20.828191+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":0,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T22:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T22:17:48.813454+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T22:17:48.813454+00:00","content_hash":"47f830b33bc640a8fad8346ef3323db7e48d2ae155359697e1f16a33ca97c5a3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}